{
  "_notes": [
    "This profile is intentionally uncalibrated. Run scripts/inspect_busy_ui.py --watch --controls with BUSY 21 open in H.S. Traders, navigate to Account Ledger manually, and copy the observed control selectors here.",
    "navigation_keys is a list of pywinauto key sequences. Example: [\"%v\", \"ACCOUNT LEDGER\", \"{ENTER}\"].",
    "A control selector is an object such as {\"class_name\": \"Edit\", \"control_id\": 1234} or {\"title\": \"From\"}.",
    "modal_titles/modal_keys confirm the Account Ledger ! and Select Format ! dialogs before the filter form is filled.",
    "format_keys must select Excel if BUSY defaults to another export format. format_control/format_value are preferred when the Data Format combo can be identified.",
    "BUSY 21 appends .xlsx itself for Microsoft Excel exports, so append_extension is true and the File Name field is filled without the extension.",
    "open_after_keys defaults to \"n\"; use \"%n\" (Alt+N) or another calibrated sequence if BUSY shows a standard Windows message box. Never use Enter here.",
    "If BUSY opens report windows as separate top-level windows, add their title regexes to allowed_dialog_title_res and set allowed_dialog_dismiss_keys to \"{ESC}\".",
    "The pipeline refuses to run until calibrated is true and every required focus key or control selector is filled in."
  ],
